# Build output. `node build.mjs` regenerates all of it.
#
# The root .gitignore excludes `dist/` as a directory, and git cannot re-include
# a file whose parent directory is excluded — so un-ignore the directory first,
# then re-ignore its contents, then keep the one file we do want versioned.
!dist/
dist/*
# The PDF is the deliverable, so it is tracked. The preview HTML and the proof
# PNGs are large and rewritten on every build, so they are not.
!dist/felican-bifold.pdf
